# Experiment C: embedding backlog on tier S data (controlled enqueue of 2,000 chunks, SQS depth,
# worker scaling, drain). Phase 15 Wave 2.
# UNAPPROVED and UNEXECUTED. Format: scripts/README.md, "Experiment manifest contract".
# No spaces in values.
# PLACEHOLDERS the human replaces before an approval record is written
# (the record binds the sha256 of the final file, so any edit needs a new record):
#   ACCOUNT_ID       123456789012 is the documented example, not a real account.
#   (DATASET_SNAPSHOT is filled: scholarchain-s-20261107-10dd7f34121b, reported by WO-4 and
#                    verified by the human.)
#   OUTPUT_ROOT      /abs/outside/repo/... is a placeholder path; pick a durable directory
#                    outside the repository.
# Limits (tier S caps of decision P15-1: 90 min, 64 clients, 20000 tasks):
#   MAX_TASKS 2000   the number of text chunks enqueued (experiments/c-embedding-backlog/run.sh,
#                    CHUNK_COUNT 2000; the entry point refuses a smaller MAX_TASKS). Was 5000 (tier M).
#   MAX_MINUTES 60   the poll stops at 55 min (MAX_MINUTES minus 5), strictly below this limit.
#   MAX_CONCURRENCY 4 is a bound on the experiment, not a worker count; the worker scaling max is
#                    set by WO-10.
# COST (HOURLY_BURN_USD and SPEND_CEILING_USD): session 2 values from WO-10, infra/terraform/COST_ESTIMATE.md,
# section "Session 2 (services) hourly burn and HIGH", paragraph "Provisional experiment burns".
# HOURLY_BURN_USD 0.45 = steady 0.37 + 3 extra workers 0.074, rounded up. Was 0.70 (tier M draft).
# SPEND_CEILING_USD 0.60 (decision P15-24): 0.45 burn x 60 min / 60 = 0.45, plus Titan V2 chunk tokens
# (0.02 to 0.06 USD) and S3 Vectors PUTs (0.05 to 0.067 USD) from infra/terraform/COST_ESTIMATE.md,
# so HIGH is about 0.58 (0.45 + 0.06 + 0.067 = 0.577), within the ceiling 0.60. Was 0.50, and 1.00 before that.
# HOURLY_BURN_USD covers the experiment hours only; the token and PUT volume costs are inside the ceiling.
# CAVEAT for the human: every rate behind the 0.37 steady burn is UNVERIFIED (memory; only the
# Fargate per-second rates are read anchors), so the value is the WO-10 figure, not a verified rate.
MANIFEST_VERSION=1
EXPERIMENT_ID=C
DESCRIPTION=embedding-backlog-sqs-depth-worker-scaling-drain-tier-s-2000-chunks
ENVIRONMENT=course
REGION=us-east-2
ACCOUNT_ID=123456789012
DATASET_SNAPSHOT=scholarchain-s-20261107-10dd7f34121b
SIZE_TIER=S
MAX_MINUTES=60
MAX_CONCURRENCY=4
MAX_TASKS=2000
SPEND_CEILING_USD=0.60
HOURLY_BURN_USD=0.45
STOP_CONDITIONS=wall-clock,first-failure,spend-estimate
METRIC_NAMES=ApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible,ApproximateNumberOfMessagesNotVisible,ApproximateAgeOfOldestMessage,NumberOfMessagesSent,NumberOfMessagesReceived,NumberOfMessagesDeleted,DesiredTaskCount,RunningTaskCount,CPUUtilization,MemoryUtilization
METRIC_NAMESPACES=AWS/SQS,ECS/ContainerInsights,AWS/ECS
OUTPUT_ROOT=/abs/outside/repo/scholarchain-experiments
ENTRY_POINT=script:experiments/c-embedding-backlog/run.sh
